From 7d5cc2aba2f0a66574bc0ebf6864ef58be867688 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Whatever4567 <Whatever4567@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 18:05:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(diamond): distinct block id 250 + faceted texture (snow
 keeps 255)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Root cause: C120 DIAMONDBLOCK and C287 PACKSNOW both used id 255; snow
won FACES so diamond looked like packed snow in world/held/inventory.
Move diamond to free id 250, keep ice-wall snow at 255, late fixer after
C287, procedural cyan/blue facets (not 4K atlas). Tests for mapping and
pixels. Integration notes for cave worker 1.2.1 — no deploy here.
